@startuml claim-states
!pragma layout smetana
title Fee claim states (one claim per completed application)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

[*] --> SUBMITTED : submit with receipt\nand certificate
SUBMITTED --> APPROVED : manager approves\nwith reason
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : manager rejects\nwith reason
REJECTED --> SUBMITTED : claimant revises\n(revision + 1,\nboth documents again)
APPROVED --> REIMBURSED : administrator registers\n(SIM- reference,\n+reimbursed in the ledger)
REIMBURSED --> [*]
@enduml
